    "## Model Choice\n",
    "\n",
    "Four deliberately simple references were considered:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Majority class** tests whether a model beats always predicting no upward move.\n",
    "2. **Random prior** predicts according to the training class distribution and is a\n",
    "   probability-quality reference.\n",
    "3. **Momentum rule** tests a common market heuristic without a fitted model.\n",
    "4. **Regularized logistic regression** is the main ML baseline: it is fast,\n",
    "   interpretable, produces probabilities, and can expose whether the engineered\n",
    "   features contain a stable linear signal.\n",
    "\n",
    "The primary metric is **log loss** (lower is better) because later threshold and\n",
    "trading decisions depend on probability quality. Balanced accuracy, ROC AUC, PR AUC,\n",
    "F1, and Brier score provide complementary discrimination, imbalance, and calibration\n",
    "views. Walk-forward CV—not the final test—selects the baseline. The saved run selected\n",
    "logistic regression by CV; random prior happened to have the best single holdout log\n",
    "loss, a warning against selecting on one period.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Feature Selection\n",
    "\n",
    "The prepared binary-h4 table contains 227,898 rows and 335 validated numeric features.\n",
    "The baseline uses all available past/current feature columns after excluding identifiers,\n",
    "target columns, target end-times, and every name containing `future`. Keeping the same\n",
    "leakage-safe feature universe as later models makes the comparison isolate model capacity.\n",
    "\n",
    "Features span trend, returns/momentum, volatility, volume/trades, candle shape, lags,\n",
    "calendar cycles, and regimes. Standardization is fitted inside each training fold only.\n",
    "Missing values, if introduced by an alternative dataset build, are median-imputed inside\n",
    "the pipeline; the recorded canonical feature table itself had none after warm-up.\n"
   ]
  },
